{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "5c9045e1e774e8eb02e77c943c60b4742021ed6aa393d4c0de92ffe37951fe24", "ja": "雑誌の撮影", "zh": "杂志拍摄", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6000_place", "source_sha256": "8ef50c20120a358ea094858d4ea7e86bd00c073826ea7a2ab98344ca8ca411f3", "ja": "山道", "zh": "山路", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6001_p", "source_sha256": "951985053f36b3e8a9af2b047bc97e663fd3371c0800455d88b83dae692e8ffc", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影がもうすぐ\n始まる。今日は亜利沙が、狐になった姿を撮る予定だ）", "zh": "（写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的拍摄马上就要开始了。今天预定拍摄亚利沙变成狐狸的模样）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6002_028ari", "source_sha256": "9c48db6ab7cd747030c7e898f11f22c0a2835d83a4dad959dc92792755ad570b", "ja": "お待たせしました、{$P$}さん！\nキツネちゃん衣装に着替えてきましたよ～。", "zh": "让您久等了，{$P$}先生！\n我已经换好小狐狸的服装啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6003_028ari", "source_sha256": "e614a20b7c07fc3ceb9d80c0676676914a9bc9cbd9c6422d1d972ef34ab89d2f", "ja": "見てください！　カワイイお耳とふさふさのしっぽ♪\nそして、このカッコイイシルエーット！", "zh": "您看！可爱的小耳朵和蓬松的尾巴♪还有这帅气的轮廓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6004_028ari", "source_sha256": "a572e74436a7e2ac9ab81bc004a55a298e4fbf4109db916acddaaec079922b49", "ja": "こんなハイクオリティな衣装でお仕事ができるなんて\n……。ありさは……ありさは、感激ですっ！", "zh": "能穿着这么高品质的服装工作……有纱……有纱真的太感动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6005_p", "source_sha256": "25ac145b481cdc84f13014e98958cb528c8b9dde4865439022792e5fdc96d0fb", "ja": "そこまで喜んでくれるなんて、嬉しいよ。\nその様子だと、撮影の準備は大丈夫そうだな！", "zh": "你能高兴成这样，我也很开心。\n看你这副样子，拍摄的准备应该没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6006_028ari", "source_sha256": "6268cd74d50d4e92b088c5fa054fdf36736a019293e4ec13a1aa16be8db68377", "ja": "ギ、ギクッ！？　あ、あの～……それがその……。\n実は、まだポーズが決まってなくて……。", "zh": "咯、咯噔！？那、那个～……其实是……。\n其实，我还没决定好要摆什么姿势……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6007_028ari", "source_sha256": "3dcdd5ce70e9bc50ac8fa85a403dc841b75e37849b5fdb495d0bf8003ce3e7d6", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　最高のキツネちゃんを\n表現するポーズ、一緒に考えてくれませんか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！能和我一起想想，\n要用什么姿势来展现最棒的小狐狸吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6008_p", "source_sha256": "2faff0c5ada8de38737baca52a3502d1707d1dab8c96a32106c6877be2b299b0", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことなら……。", "zh": "原来如此，如果是这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6009", "source_sha256": "9f7d422371584e4aea8a63d16103b4ceedde41534ebe3a15edd4639478317f55", "ja": "影絵のポーズ", "zh": "手影姿势", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6010", "source_sha256": "1fd866dc85758f6596f2ed40c4637d2a126482d362ec8bca0bf731b56e94a842", "ja": "かわいいポーズ", "zh": "可爱的姿势", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6011", "source_sha256": "7ee63d2e1ae72429ad26225fc7ec2bcb9cdbd86728e62e9f9fda6543747661d8", "ja": "狩りのポーズ", "zh": "狩猎姿势", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6100_p", "source_sha256": "0ba8d4e2ca91f2d8b15da6a5aed7dbb1ade7fd65102ede4184bd6624c8c36d25", "ja": "影絵とかで、手で狐を作るだろ？\nあれを取り入れたら、可愛いと思ったんだが。", "zh": "玩手影戏的时候，不是会用手比出狐狸吗？\n我想着要是能加进这个动作，应该会很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6101_028ari", "source_sha256": "00cc5ab0a3ba648688d90c8168317a657a13a090aca0c9d099c758ea47a13447", "ja": "なるほど、両手でカワイイキツネちゃん……。そして、\nありさを含めて三匹のキツネちゃんにするんですね！", "zh": "原来如此，用双手做出可爱的狐狸……然后，再加上亚利沙，变成三只可爱的狐狸对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6102_028ari", "source_sha256": "1d1f4748fadd54128a3d21b47bd71644089574db5e2a2c37be0bc09849558758", "ja": "カワイイはいくつあってもカワイイ……！\nさすが{$P$}さん、わかってますね♪", "zh": "可爱再多也还是可爱……！\n不愧是{$P$}先生，真懂行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6200_p", "source_sha256": "effdd58d32e057fbfd7f9c8e18d4d2e871a9c94ae8edfd47b9b4e51e57be3068", "ja": "大きなしっぽを振ってみたりして、\n感情を表現してみたら可愛いんじゃないか？", "zh": "试着摇摇大尾巴来表达感情，\n会不会很可爱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6201_028ari", "source_sha256": "d0b252bc5d941783d36f681ed2684dec30961ff25e549b073eb4236c9009bfc3", "ja": "ああ……わかりますぅ！　このふさふさのしっぽは、\nこの衣装で絶対にアピールしたいポイント！", "zh": "啊啊……我懂了！这条毛茸茸的尾巴，\n绝对是这套服装想要好好展现的亮点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6202_028ari", "source_sha256": "f01bc8bff099468fcd88f07faa11753b96c5390ffa0a788165c74461faaada55", "ja": "しっぽをぶんぶん振って喜びを、しゅんと垂らして\n悲しみを……。ありさ、ちょっと練習してきますっ！", "zh": "用尾巴使劲摇来表达喜悦，再垂头丧气地垂下来表达悲伤……有利沙，我先去练习一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6300_p", "source_sha256": "496053dd91277ab3b8dc842e5f9ee225e3afbcd90323a6c196a180c4830cb714", "ja": "狐の狩りを参考にしてみるのはどうかな。\n捕まえる時にジャンプする姿が可愛いと思うんだ。", "zh": "不妨参考一下狐狸捕猎的样子。\n我觉得它们捕捉猎物时跳跃的姿势很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6301_028ari", "source_sha256": "d9b146a81b0fde1d6c60528bc57fa013212d2b6a1ea42bf9116de66773a2b933", "ja": "ふむふむ……。獲物を狙う鋭い目つきと、\nカワイイジャンプのギャップで最高を表現すると……。", "zh": "嗯嗯……用锁定猎物时的锐利眼神，和可爱的跳跃形成反差，来表现最棒的一面……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_6302_028ari", "source_sha256": "bce807189c421d7afbb693f57eb4f6f81e50d3be6343e54f00f6d0a564619a04", "ja": "わかりましたっ！　ありさ、思いっきり飛んでみます！\nあっ、もちろんケガしない程度に！", "zh": "我明白了！亚利沙会全力跳跃试试看的！\n啊，当然是在不会受伤的限度内！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
